[color=#cc0000][size=4]⚠️ [b][u]Heads up[/u][/b][/size][/color]
This page now hosts the [b]Chrome & Blood Modlist Settings[/b] only.

[color=#5cbdcf][size=5][b][u]What is Chrome & Blood?[/u][/b][/size][/color]
[b]Chrome & Blood[/b] reworks combat, enemy AI, hacking, cyberware, and the economy in [i]Cyberpunk 2077[/i]. Version 5.0 uses one profile, balanced around [b]Very Hard[/b], and adds repeatable fixer work through [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/35142]Much Better Contracts[/url].

Existing saves are supported; a new game is recommended for 5.0. Some graphical mods are kept in the list but temporarily disabled while we wait for their Cyberpunk 2.5 updates.

Screenshots, the mod list, and installation instructions are on the [url=https://qcargile.github.io/Chrome-Blood/][b]official website[/b][/url].

[color=#5cbdcf][size=4][b][u]Install[/u][/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*]Download [url=https://github.com/qcargile/CyberpunkModlistSetup/releases/download/v1.0.1/ChromeBlood-Setup-1.0.1.zip]Chrome & Blood Setup 1.0.1[/url], extract the entire ZIP, and run [b]ChromeBloodSetup.exe[/b]. Keep Assets and licenses beside it.[/*]
[*]Review the game and prerequisites, then open C&B in Wabbajack to install. Launch through MO2 with [b]Chrome & Blood - Standard Profile[/b].[/*]
[*]Or follow the full [url=https://qcargile.github.io/Chrome-Blood/install.html]install guide[/url] on the website.[/*]
[/list]

[url=https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a265d0bdc2b9a9054a58b3f06632172d525f7fc45d9d4fc1e5c24702c9366e49]VirusTotal report for the Setup 1.0.1 executable[/url]

[color=#5cbdcf][size=4][b][u]Requirements[/u][/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*]Official [b]Cyberpunk 2077[/b] + [b]Phantom Liberty DLC[/b], PC patch 2.5[/*]
[*][b]SSD required[/b] · [b]Windows 10/11[/b] only[/*]
[*]Check Wabbajack's storage requirements and allow extra space for extraction and cleanup backups.[/*]
[/list]

